    "hash_7e508d262881fca": "An estimated 158 deaths at the Kastovian base, with more than 200 injured.",
    "hash_53a622cd3849e8d0": "The Kremlin blames Urzikstan for what they call a brutal and unjustifiable attack. They are asking world leaders to join them in denouncing the ULF as a terrorist organization.",
    "hash_7c00578b96e3fb4f": "Absolutely nothing! It\xe2\x80\x99s clear the ULF remains at large and for all we know they have weapons in striking distance of Moscow!",
    "hash_382fe952d9edef10": "How do we know we\xe2\x80\x99re safe?",
    "hash_e73aef7da332c61": "Urzikstan has been a terrorist hot spot for years! Yet what has been done about it?",
    "hash_e32a539a5dc09c7": "No! Let me go! I need to get to that phone!",
    "hash_5a99ca68606a96f7": "He\xe2\x80\x99s got a gun!",
    "hash_78d0ae43799a67fe": "She\xe2\x80\x99s got a gun!",
    "hash_2d7941d958a2c844": "Stop... Stop it\xe2\x80\x94! DON'T SHO\xe2\x80\x94!!",
    "hash_85f92275420e037": "We\xe2\x80\x99re beginning our meal service. A list of selections can be found in your seat pocket.",
    "hash_52d1f623c273b9c2": "A great victory for the ULF!",
    "hash_505cb6b6a8e9b144": "All of you! DOWN! NOW!!",
    "hash_53364272d39e3ff2": "Anyone else?",
