    "hash_4a40334fc1037dbd": "Family is everything.",
    "hash_28887a0c34792ed5": "Get up.",
    "hash_7c6f780265cc8a57": "I know you\xe2\x80\xa6Samara. You were a soldier in the ULF. You fought the Russians.",
    "hash_4e5d7fe64be11da4": "Let's go.",
    "hash_145547f20a1dabfb": "Listen and don't speak. We're taking control of this plane. The flight crew, the air marshals. They're all with us. And so are you. For Urzikstan.",
    "hash_73ea5cd7248fb117": "Years ago.",
    "hash_29c2ab7dc1295bbd": "You have a beautiful family.",
    "hash_5cdacfd1ff4c5f3a": "Your daughter Rabia.",
    "hash_46ea68ed78a04294": "Your son Tariq. And Khalid, your husband.",
    "hash_64e210216fd3c971": "Ladies and gentlemen, we\xe2\x80\x99ve reached our cruising altitude. You\xe2\x80\x99re free to move about the cabin.",
    "hash_320c0b16d4a865f1": "Drop your guns!",
    "hash_25c13e86ab989cad": "Air Marshal\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94! Drop your weapons!",
    "hash_21d53ab795556754": "Security! Drop your weapon!",
    "hash_f57321443cbf7ec": "Do we know each other?",
    "hash_7d6bc0b671f4d817": "How do you\xe2\x80\xa6?",
    "hash_38985dc05047ab24": "No no no, please, there are more\xe2\x80\x94",
    "hash_1778dc22eff979fa": "Thank you.",
    "hash_629b546f209de02": "Yes. My daughter has a birthday coming.",
    "hash_62accd02d745ca9b": "Yes. Years ago.",
    "hash_b3cead94f224d3d": "Are you a terrorist?",
    "hash_19dc3df38735067e": "Go get it!",
    "hash_15a1c5925f5d5b52": "You look like one.",
    "hash_40fd7add2cace91d": "We are below eight thousand feet, sir.",
    "hash_3d436481e36b3eaf": "For Urzikstan, Samara\xe2\x80\xa6 For your family\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_116914a9516e3148": "Hello Samara.",
    "hash_1a53d0ac76d2d657": "History\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_7ef66b2c5b6d9054": "Leave no trace!",
    "hash_32eca9e26fca27d9": "No, I\xe2\x80\x99m not killing them\xe2\x80\xa6 You are\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_68416551d3fa6851": "No\xe2\x80\xa6 You're a citizen soldier inspired by Farah Karim to fight Russia. You\xe2\x80\x99re a freedom fighter.",
    "hash_2931e140b4d14883": "Shh-shhh\xe2\x80\xa6 You will be a hero for what you're doing here, Samara.",
    "hash_5666078737b8af09": "This is about who you are, Samara\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_7f3b9e38dec6a2d1": "We're descending. Give me the vest.",
    "hash_6a30b0e4af812305": "You exceeded my expectations today.",
    "hash_381091dde7be8408": "Get this off of me you fucking sonuvabitch\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_61f41494dd7d241c": "Give me that phone you sick bastard! We can stop this!",
    "hash_54eb3f3d6dfeeb06": "Help me! Give me the cell phone!",
    "hash_31327f4db51e8f26": "Hurry! Give it to me! Give me the phone!",
    "hash_24d01195abac5d47": "No one will believe you. I am not a terrorist\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_6f417302d7dc8cfe": "No\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_593abe10b7eb4651": "Please! We're going to die!",
    "hash_664aeee5493ed9a4": "Stop it- Get your fucking hands off of me!",
    "hash_e0bf23701ed3bd7": "We have to defuse the bomb!",
    "hash_fbbbb2f05a1eec7": "What is this?",
    "hash_754d662ef3db1a8": "Who do you think you are?",
    "hash_1b63e624eb730086": "You have to help me!",
    "hash_f1c8ac68e3b2f61": "You're Russian- this plane is full of Russians. How could you kill your own people?",
